CurrentMusic for Windows 1.0\par\par
Native Windows music client for the CurrentMusic service.\par
This project is provided for learning and personal use. Access to music depends on the service and your account. Respect the rights of content owners.\par\par
Installation includes the .NET runtime, Windows App SDK runtime, and redistributable Microsoft C++ runtime components. Their respective licenses apply.\par\par
Your session is stored in Windows Credential Manager. Preferences are stored in your local user profile. Uninstalling removes the program; preferences and credentials are retained for reinstall. Sign out before uninstalling if you want to remove the saved session.\par\par
Project and service: https://music.20110208.xyz\par
